      "grid_message_index_0based": 7,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "式神まで！？\nナキメさんの声、なんだか伝染してませんか！？",
      "jp_sha256": "bce15de6bc0414aa61aee393e29efb35612e54b14801a8badb731d745ce87448",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "식신까지!?\n나키메 씨 목소리, 왠지 전염되고 있지 않나요!?",
      "message_index_0based": 7,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 18,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b013-20261109-same-model-pass2-5adf61fa",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "cfd1756bb7fc274374264ccc2f7727024d53b663d070bf66335c0224c6d57c8d:000002_4732811560115032234:g0:r17",
      "row_index_0based": 17,
      "serialized_row_index": 17,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "式神まで！？\nナキメさんの声、なんだか伝染してませんか！？"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "29604e1cf5d823aa1f0f88b7be4486d26ac51691228a9842fee7412be96671b3",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 8,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "いいえご主人さま。所詮は贋作、ニセモノですわ。\n本物は最後の方の声がかすれ、そこに切なさがあるのです。",
      "jp_sha256": "7a0219ea331bc151a937f85182ec40e6243934ddd40ff2910f66a816aa843add",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "아니에요, 주인님. 어차피 모조품, 가짜이사와요.\n진짜는 마지막 부분에서 목소리가 갈라지고, 거기에 애절함이 있답니다.",
      "message_index_0based": 8,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 22,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b013-20261109-same-model-pass2-5adf61fa",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "cfd1756bb7fc274374264ccc2f7727024d53b663d070bf66335c0224c6d57c8d:000002_4732811560115032234:g0:r21",
      "row_index_0based": 21,
      "serialized_row_index": 21,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "ナナエ",
        "Emt1_Nor",
        "layer_左中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "いいえご主人さま。所詮は贋作、ニセモノですわ。\n本物は最後の方の声がかすれ、そこに切なさがあるのです。",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "ナナエ",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "7b9f10a7f0a9a68370b1b2b59959043ea22766364fd778042700f519f233e318",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 9,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "しかし、感情の乱れを表すビブラートは光るものがありました。\n行為の激しさを想像させられて、わたくしは好きですわ。\n式神の方々、まずは日常的に活用されてみてはいかがでしょうか。",
      "jp_sha256": "70ef7659a4130ab03a0af423fdaa4a1f8f516caba53ee07e927db50ddfebf7b0",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "하지만 감정의 동요를 나타내는 비브라토는 빛나는 점이 있었사와요.\n행위의 격렬함을 상상하게 해 줘서 저는 마음에 듭니다.\n식신 여러분, 우선 일상적으로 활용해 보시는 건 어떨까요.",
      "message_index_0based": 9,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 23,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b013-20261109-same-model-pass2-5adf61fa",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "cfd1756bb7fc274374264ccc2f7727024d53b663d070bf66335c0224c6d57c8d:000002_4732811560115032234:g0:r22",
      "row_index_0based": 22,
      "serialized_row_index": 22,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "ナナエ",
        "Emt1_Nor",
        "layer_左中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "しかし、感情の乱れを表すビブラートは光るものがありました。\n行為の激しさを想像させられて、わたくしは好きですわ。\n式神の方々、まずは日常的に活用されてみてはいかがでしょうか。",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        ""
      ],
